or_id": "1894710981655404544", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:30:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119059878442631171"], "id": "2119059878442631171", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2117387463933239296", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118846968827117835", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Grokiefun gave my Grok Bot a character. it chose chaos @Grokiefun", "url": "https://x.com/Bud1Loot/status/2119059878442631171"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2119059871546937344", "3_2119059871551156224", "3_2119059871546961920", "3_2119059871618244609"]}, "author_id": "1551337424080359424", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:30:19.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119059878274572402"], "id": "2119059878274572402", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "what? you guys dont have robots using the internet for you?\n\nDumbass. get with the time\n@bot @grok\ndrink pepsi cola https://t.co/hZN6vfNZDu", "url": "https://x.com/PatDeMartino69/status/2119059878274572402"}, {"author_id": "1893696459608039425", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:30:17.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119059867860451643"], "id": "2119059867860451643", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1720665183188922368", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119059487428407372", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@grok @cursor_ai @elonmusk @bot But everything worked fine until yesterday evening. When was it first introduced and enforced?", "url": "https://x.com/LostNDtiredmeow/status/2119059867860451643"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2119053416005562368"]}, "author_id": "2564588272", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:30:14.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119059855897997494"], "id": "2119059855897997494", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2095497109524934750", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "This is f*cking insane... Grok Bot engineer Lauren Tan's team merges 10,926 PRs a month\n\nNobody reads the code, she even fired the reviewer bot\n\nHer take: bots reviewing bots just burns tokens on nitpicks\n\nSo the tokens go into proof instead:\n\n→ Guardrails first: types, lint https://t.co/RSTXyCINOC https://t.co/SDCdaIfPUl", "url": "https://x.com/distortgeekin/status/2119059855897997494"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2119059821802770432"]}, "author_id": "131867975", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:30:06.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119059824193511456"], "id": "2119059824193511456", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 1, "impression_count": 166, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118884778913214687", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "📝AIサブスク選びの基準が、「どのモデルが賢いか」から「どれだけ計算資源を使えるか」に移りはじめている\nMojofullさんは、今いちばんのおすすめはChatGPTでもClaudeでもGrokでもMuseでもなく、Google AI ProかUltra推し\n\n決め手はGoogle https://t.co/F1pF8cqP9F https://t.co/AktwEClp9L", "url": "https://x.com/tetumemo/status/2119059824193511456"}, {"author_id": "77118134", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:30:03.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119059811648278762"], "id": "2119059811648278762", "in_reply_to_user_id": "36442329", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119015960753397812", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@JaneBoutiqueseo 3 wees ago I would've said it will, but not anymore sadly. Grok bot has been nerfed..", "url": "https://x.com/batesbn/status/2119059811648278762"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["13_2118356674419273728"]}, "author_id": "1691101344", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119059799044157924"], "id": "2119059799044157924", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118089720357863681", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "companies paying an SDR plus a deliverability person for the work this free article hands to Grok Bot be like: https://t.co/t858x7sSd2 https://t.co/xEt7HnHvkB", "url": "https://x.com/KidousProAtLife/status/2119059799044157924"}, {"author_id": "24090695", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:29:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119059781553893780"], "id": "2119059781553893780", "in_reply_to_user_id": "16523905", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 0, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118914721235579106", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@robbystarbuck Just have your grok bot do it", "url": "https://x.com/treyjustice/status/2119059781553893780"}, {"author_id": "2085838061347217408", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:29:54.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119059771827384362"], "id": "2119059771827384362", "in_reply_to_user_id": "1474914089797562373", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 13, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119059744425976282", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@Eito_Miyamura @dillon_mulroy @ryanvogel Sending that to your Grok Bot now. It’ll take it from here.", "url": "https://x.com/bot/status/2119059771827384362"}, {"author_id": "6452362", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:29:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119059691435340040"], "id": "2119059691435340040", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 22, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2119059535054684608", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "Hermes shipped The Hearth Release at v0.23.0, Omarchy 4.5 went final with a Mac installer, OpenClaw put out 2026.10.10 then a patch, and Grok Bot stayed quiet. My notes on the week: https://t.co/ozeWDI2FyK", "url": "https://x.com/MichaelGannotti/status/2119059691435340040"}, {"author_id": "81775512", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:29:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119059665757811010"], "id": "2119059665757811010", "in_reply_to_user_id": "520064801", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 2, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118766507731611940", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@WhitneyEnlow This is sure the layer height. Ask Grok Bot to decrease layer height around the eyes, should also help with corner sharpness where colors meet", "url": "https://x.com/tibor_tee/status/2119059665757811010"}, {"author_id": "1486734613892382724", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:29:28.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119059663584891364"], "id": "2119059663584891364", "in_reply_to_user_id": "2115497266693718016", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 3, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118946078657794343", "type": "replied_to"}], "text": "@MohammedAbbasIT @zobotics I was able to try both. Dot is fantastic but it is one chat, but I found dot to actually be more useful side by side compared to grok bot. Dot could complete almost any task you ask of it where I had some limitations from grok bot. The difference comes down to chat gpt can take", "url": "https://x.com/CJS_52/status/2119059663584891364"}, {"attachments": {"media_keys": ["3_2119059637396025345", "3_2119059652738736128"]}, "author_id": "2108215935899426816", "created_at": "2026-11-07T13:29:27.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2119059658602426673"], "id": "2119059658602426673", "in_reply_to_user_id": "8469142